<p>This SCP is both a medium for an idea I had revolving around a spatially linked biological anomaly, and will serve as sort of a&#8230;hub for micro themed articles of sorts. Of course I'm not going to saturate the wiki with new Micro SCP's every week, nor am I going to be repetitive with the descriptions. SCPs attached to this&#8230;sub series I guess is what I will call it will be more focused on the individual parts and stories that each of these things have to convey about the world building I am beginning through these articles so to speak. Technical writing is where I excel, so I'm challenging myself to weave an interconnected series of entities that are self contained in their own stories, but play into a larger narrative that I'm just beginning to plan.</p>
<p>Sorry, there was a lot of babbling in there. Basically, are the articles connected? Yes. Will there be an ever expanding list? Probably not. What you see in the article are a variety of Ideas that have popped into my head, and that I think I might be able to develop into separate articles. Some of them will probably never be written, purely because they fall too closely to what I already did with 2946. Others are so bizarrely different that it would be a crime for me not to write an article about them.</p>

